Description: PEMsamplr is a subpackage of "PEMr" and forms part of the workflow to 
  develop Predictive Ecosystem Maps (PEM). Specifically this package builds on data 
  prepared using the PEMprepr package and generates a field sampling plan to collect
  data for modeling. 
